1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,360
THE CEO: You rebooted the whole building?

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:03,410
You are the IT help desk.

3
00:00:03,450 --> 00:00:06,060
A COLLEAGUE: My screen’s dead!

4
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:08,960
YOU: Turned it off and on?

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
YOU: Off. On. Fixed! Next!

6
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:15,900
THE CEO: My internet is broken. Fix it!

7
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:18,500
YOU: Off… and on.

8
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:22,060
YOU: It’s all rebooting!

9
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:24,600
THE CEO: Internet fixed?

10
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:30,660
THE CEO: Oh. It was unplugged.

11
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:34,350
THE CEO: Fired. Go be a flight attendant.

